"{\n  \"AND\": {\n    \"left\": {\n      \"AND\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Prior treatment with gemcitabine, carboplatin (except in the adjuvant setting), or Iniparib.\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"or other prior chemotherapy.\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"AND\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Past or current history of neoplasm other than the entry diagnosis, with the exception of treated non-melanoma skin cancer or carcinoma in-situ of any primary site, or invasive cancers treated definitively, with treatment ending >5 years previously and no evidence of recurrences.\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"or a history of cardiac disease, as defined by:\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"Malignant hypertension, unstable angina, congestive heart failure, myocardial infarction within the previous 6 months, or symptomatic, unstable or uncontrolled, cardiac arrhythmias.\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"stable, rate-controlled atrial fibrillation.\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"or other cardiac disease.\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"OR\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"Active brain metastases.\"\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"Patients with treated brain metastases are eligible, if (1) radiation therapy was completed at least 2 weeks prior to study entry; (2) follow-up scan shows no disease progression; and (3) patient does not require steroids.\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"or other brain metastases.\"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"right\": {\n        \"OR\": {\n          \"left\": {\n            \"raw_text\": \"Women who are pregnant or lactating.\"\n          },\n          \"right\": {\n            \"AND\": {\n              \"left\": {\n                \"raw_text\": \"Any serious, active infection (> Grade 2) at the time of treatment.\"\n              },\n              \"right\": {\n                \"raw_text\": \"or other serious infections.\"\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"right\": {\n      \"OR\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"raw_text\": \"A serious underlying medical condition that would impair the ability of the patient to receive protocol treatment.\"\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"A major surgical procedure, or significant traumatic injury ≤28 days of beginning treatment, or anticipation of the need for major surgery during the course of the study.\"\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"or other surgical procedures.\"\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}"